# Description
In this challenge, to find out who is preventing the program from running. The zip file contained a bunch of different files and
documents.

# Solution
When i opened the zip file, it had a git folder that contained a bunch of other folders. I simply just located the one that said
logs because I assumed thats where I would find the flag. Inside the folder, there was a file labled "HEAD" which i opened in 
notepad and inside the file, there was a lot of logs for each commit. The second log from the top log shown the flag.

